SCOPE OF THE ABOVE

The MIT licence above covers only what this 1.6 port added:

  - the changes made to the C# to run on 1.6, and the fixes listed in
    ATTRIBUTION.md
  - the rewritten English text
  - the README, the CHANGELOG and the attribution notes

IT DOES NOT COVER THE ORIGINAL MOD. The creatures, the 88 textures, the three
sounds, the 133 defs, the Simplified Chinese translation and the whole design
of "山海志怪-华夏凶兽和基因扩展 - Ancient Chinese Beast And Gene Expanded" are
the work of andery233xj, Frolg, DongFang and Ninedaylongbow, reused here:

  https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3292446841

The source review recorded on 2026-09-12 found no explicit licence, reuse
permission or prohibition for the original material. Abandonment is not
established. No licence for that material is granted here.

This unofficial port is distributed without the original authors' explicit
consent, with credit, a link to the original, and removal on request. These
commitments do not constitute permission from the original authors.

If any of the four authors asks for this to be taken down, it comes down.
Immediately, and without discussion.

ATTRIBUTION.md records what was taken and what was changed.
